    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ceylon",
        "text": "Schwarz, I want to go observe the ecosystem of the beach!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_348_ceylon_4#6",
            "name2": "char_340_shwaz_2#1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Schwarz",
        "text": "You mustn't, milady. Master Doykos said you must not go outside without good reason."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_348_ceylon_4#1",
            "name2": "char_340_shwaz_2#1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ceylon",
        "text": "But I'm tired of reading the same old books here! Schwarz, you're no fun at all!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_348_ceylon_4#1",
            "name2": "char_340_shwaz_2#3",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Schwarz",
        "text": "My apologies, milady. This is for your safety though; it's dangerous outside."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_348_ceylon_4#4",
            "name2": "char_340_shwaz_2#3",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ceylon",
        "text": "But won't you be with me? Are you going to put me in danger?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_348_ceylon_4#4",
            "name2": "char_340_shwaz_2#3",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Schwarz",
        "text": "...Of course I wouldn't."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_348_ceylon_4#6",
            "name2": "char_340_shwaz_2#3",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ceylon",
        "text": "So, what's the problem then? Let's go!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_348_ceylon_4#6",
            "name2": "char_340_shwaz_2#3",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Schwarz",
        "text": "...In that case, please do not stray from my sight."
    },
