        "text": "If I remember properly, he's the grandson of the owner of the Mockingbird Caf\u00e9 on Second Avenue."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ceylon",
        "text": "I used to go there a lot. The old storekeeper was a kind man. His wife had already passed away at that time, so he decorated the caf\u00e9 with her favorite flowers and bonsai trees, and put on their favorite music."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ceylon",
        "text": "But he did say that he was getting too old to run the shop, and would pass the business over to his grandson."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ceylon",
        "text": "Time sure flies."
